{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">花旗：恒瑞医药FY26创新药销售增速节奏变化</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">恒瑞医药<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>上半年成绩单里，最值得<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>的不是总营收，而是创新药销售增速的回落。1H26创新药收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">88.1亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>，对比1Q26的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26%</span>同比增速明显节奏变化。这份<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>研报把原因拆得很清楚：肿瘤线创新药只增长了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.6%</span>，而代谢、自免等非肿瘤线创新药增长了74%。同一家公司内部，两条产品线的增速差了近30倍。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">总营收<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">155亿元</span>，同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>，净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">45亿元</span>，基本持平。仿制药收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">51.4亿元</span>，同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16.1%</span>，集采续约降价和公司主动把资源往创新药倾斜是主因。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>预计下半年总营收增速能回到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11%</span>左右，靠的是新适应症获批和NRDL纳入后的销售爬坡。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUO2ZxRB2ZEULsJLpUDAKZMEfIfeIIp33aCWRFJ9Bko1lrNtXnGpxJp0KAX4ynXlJzUMg8tt0cy45tPYkndtBT32nNNf12atAM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 肿瘤线增长仍在调整，非肿瘤线成为新引擎</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">肿瘤创新药收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">62.7亿元</span>，只增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.6%</span>。瑞维鲁胺、达尔西利和新纳入医保的 trastuzumab rezetecan 在贡献增量，但吡咯替尼、阿帕替尼和19K这些成熟产品正承受竞争和医保价格调整的双重不确定性。一边是新药放量，一边是老药降价，两股力量几乎抵消。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">非肿瘤创新药收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25.5亿元</span>，增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">74%</span>。代谢管线是主要驱动力，加上艾玛昔替尼、夫努单抗和瑞卡西单抗在NRDL纳入后的爬坡。这条线的体量还不到肿瘤线的三分之一，但增速决定了创新药整体增速的下限。如果非肿瘤线能保持这个势头，创新药<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">16%</span>的增速还有向<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">上修</span>正的空间。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看肿瘤线<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.6%</span>这个数字，它说明恒瑞的成熟创新药已经进入降价周期，靠老产品维持高增长的时代结束了。简单说，非肿瘤线<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">74%</span>的增速是在低基数上实现的，能否持续取决于代谢管线的放量节奏；我更关注的是口服GLP-1药物HRS-7535的临床进展，它决定了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>后非肿瘤线的增长天花板。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWB3QJ44I3nJCQlxia4Z8nk3jX4W6icccrVVukVjr9U6FlVTsLuxT9W0mWxiaZkHuu4dbh3iaAVO6icwHZsIk9M11libpe4OoCZDRLk4/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 管理层下调创新药增长指引，与股权激励目标挂钩</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">管理层建议参考ESOP目标来理解创新药销售预期：<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>/27/28年分别为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">192亿</span>/<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">240亿</span>/<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">300亿元</span>，对应<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">17%</span>/<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>/<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>的同比增速。这与此前全年30%同比增速的指引有明显差距。Citi认为，这不是基本面出现变化，而是管理层在主动管理预期。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>测算，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>全年BD授权收入约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">36亿元</span>，高于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">34亿元</span>。上半年license-out收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14亿元</span>，同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28.6%</span>，主要来自GSK合作；BMS交易的6亿美元首付款预计在3Q26确认。这笔钱还没进报表，但已经计入Citi的盈利模型。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWHhxz5WQtcfzk075qVTqNw4yZ61GUcg5D1ic2fHa3qI13IPMn1Sq1ImlNbygWb3fOxdgicK7bG2294JE4DGLIMWl4iaadj3S041Q/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 管线执行是亮点，40+新获批预期支撑长期逻辑</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">管理层预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>-28年将有40多项新药获批，覆盖五个治疗领域。1H26已有7项产品/适应症获批，10项NDA/MAA受理，6项CDE突破性疗法认定，启动18项III期临床，10个新分子进入临床。达尔西利获批HR+/HER2-早期乳腺癌辅助治疗，Retlirafusp alfa（PD-L1/TGF-β RII）获批一线PD-L1+胃癌，这是全球首创机制。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXmrHMqOJbM7MpyCKicuBj56Yqx6ed63ZpvukDGcJ6YsrqcjzR67838KzqoF6KbObfm8hIsNlN4d5PMiafpwySWueVB6It65lv1w/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 17-CITI-Jiangsu Hengrui Pharmaceuticals -600276- Slower Innovative Drugs Sales Growth in FY26-260820</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
